description "Alora

A quick and versatile hybrid duelist.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 12% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Dual/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Chain Limit: 4
-- 7% less Dual/8% more Blue damage
-- 35% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage
- DL-44 Heavy Blaster Pistol (Bryar 3)
-- 25% more charged FP drain
-- 20% less velocity
- Thermal Grenade (3)
- Det Pack (3)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (1)
- Rage (3) ^3[CS2]
- Lightning (1) ^3[CS3]
- Mind Trick (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (3)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Block (3)
- Fury (1)
- Aerial Resource Regen
- Sense Immunity
- Tracking Beacon
- Uncivilized

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"